  "interpretation_limits": [
    "This is one ordered reference/persistent/optimized trial. Filesystem cache and machine state can affect times; there is no repeat-based uncertainty estimate.",
    "The conditions compare complete workflows, not isolated changes. Reference performs 3 native preparation calls, persistent 6, and optimized 3. Their metadata cache capacities and traversal order differ. The whole timing difference cannot be attributed only to model persistence.",
    "Optimized cache statistics show observed reuse within its 256 MiB retained-frame limit. This run does not isolate the speed contribution of frame reuse, metadata reuse or overlapping preparation.",
    "All conditions use request batch size one. GPU microbatch admission and performance are not established by this benchmark.",
    "Exact captions, temporal plans and input tensor agreement establish compatibility. They do not establish annotation accuracy.",
    "The runtime tensor comparison matches the corpus multiset of stage-and-input digests; runtime lines do not supply episode IDs. Per-episode source/temporal/caption audits are compared separately.",
    "All result exports occur after complete inference, so the three latency values are close. These are offline batch result latencies, not online request latency.",
    "Per-condition allocated GPU-hour throughput and complete host-memory peaks are unmeasured.",
    "Adaptive development and final evaluation are pending."
  ],
  "measurement_boundaries": {
    "cache": "Counts cover retained RGB frame payloads only, measured before backend cleanup. They exclude other process memory.",
    "cli": "Includes manifest hashing, setup, preparation, inference, model cleanup and annotation export. Ends before final summary writing and SQLite close.",
    "cpu_work": "Counters sum engine preparation work and can overlap GPU work. They exclude earlier CLI/worker manifest hashing and are not allocated CPU core-hours.",
    "latency": "All jobs arrive at engine start. Each result becomes available when its serialized export completes, after all inference and model cleanup. Latency excludes CLI setup and scheduler wait.",
    "primary": "Subprocess wall includes process startup, worker checks, the full CLI invocation and process exit.",
    "runtime_events": "Parameter verification is a prefix of full session load. Generation events exclude preparation, input hashing and transfer. These nested measurements must not be added to workflow wall time.",
    "stage_attempt": "Excludes input preparation, attempt creation and final checkpoint commit. Includes model loading when triggered and native stage execution.",
    "worker": "Starts inside the worker function; excludes earlier imports and process launch/exit."
  },
